        "density": 0.14642,
        "chars": 139,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.93
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        199,
        1849,
        1505,
        1960
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, pursuant to the *Nunez* Court Orders, on January 5, 2024, DOC requested that the Monitor advise and provide feedback to DOC on how the requirements of Local Law 42 would impact DOC's ability to comply with the *Nunez* Court Orders; and",
